+//! Strict composed verification for one finalized causal peg-in mint transition.
+//!
+//! The request preserves the unchanged T20C Frontier transition and reuses its parent/child trie
+//! proofs to authenticate the causal runtime state in the same roots. The resulting report binds
+//! pending V2 admission consumption and its federated source-proof receipt to the actual finalized
+//! child header. The receipt authenticates the static compatibility profile selected by the
+//! runtime; it does not establish Ergo consensus, trustless source verification, mint authority,
+//! or Gate 5 closure.
+
+use bridge_state_proof::{
+	peg_in_causal_mint_transition_v3::{
+		derive_bridge_storage_map_key_v2, derive_bridge_storage_value_key_v2,
+		verify_causal_peg_in_mint_transition_v3, CausalMintExecutionBindingV3,
+		CausalPegInMintTransitionProofError,
