+//! Strict composed verification for one finalized successful Frontier `PegIn` event.
+//!
+//! The request embeds the unchanged V1 execution-identity request and reuses its exact bounded
+//! trie nodes, which must additionally prove `Ethereum::CurrentReceipts` and
+//! `Ethereum::CurrentTransactionStatuses` under the same finalized native state root. The report
+//! proves receipt ordering/root, transaction/status identity, successful execution, and exact
+//! `PegIn(address,uint256,bytes32)` semantics. It performs no network, filesystem, signing,
+//! submission, broadcast, vault-eligibility, mint-selection, or release action.
+
+use bridge_state_proof::peg_in_frontier_event_v1::{
+	derive_ethereum_current_receipts_storage_key,
